<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets 1.0 bln Frf seven-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets 1.0 bln Frf seven-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager Morgan Stanley SA (books), Credit Lyonnais and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN STANLEY GROUP INC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    26.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.254   PAY DATE    26.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.754    SPREAD	+42 B.P</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    PAR/LON   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOV BOND  6.75 PCT 2003 OAT.</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
